  <name>NitroBolt</name>
  <developer id="org.nitrobolt"></developer>
  <summary>A TurboWarp modification built beyond Scratch compatibility</summary>
  <description>
    <p>NitroBolt is a mod of TurboWarp with tons of new features, and a haven for developers who don't want to be restricted by "compatibility".</p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Git Projects with reviewable files and integrated version-control tools</li>
      <li>Live Collaboration rooms for working on projects together in real time</li>
      <li>Advanced procedures with global, branched, dual-mode, and typed blocks</li>
      <li>An integrated debugger with logs, threads, performance data, and timers</li>
      <li>An Assets tab for viewing and managing project assets</li>
      <li>A reworked sound editor</li>
      <li>Custom addons and reusable extension packs</li>
      <li>Expanded stage and camera controls</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You can also use NitroBolt in your browser at https://nitrobolt.org/editor</p>
    <p>The screenshots show Tale of Farth by mrgallifrey on Discord running in NitroBolt Desktop.</p>
  </description>
